-- Stretch order (levels: the route test's model from 29.7):
--   1 the Shimmering Flats, hearth to Freewind, the Crossroads and Orgrimmar (swarm quest, trainers), Ratchet, the
--     boat; 2 Stranglethorn first (its hunts open at 28, everything else in this bracket needs 30): Booty Bay,
--     Nesingwary's camp, Grom'gol, the trolls, back to Booty Bay; 3 the zeppelin to Orgrimmar, Dustwallow from Camp
--     Taurajo; 4 Ratchet, Sun Rock, Desolace (Ghost Walker Post, the caravan, Shadowprey, the coast, Mannoroc);
--     5 Orgrimmar, the zeppelin to the Undercity, Tarren Mill and Alterac; 6 Arathi (Hammerfall, the binding stones,
--     Faldir's Cove); 7 the walk to the Badlands (Martek, Kargath, Lotwil); 8 on foot through the Riverglades to
--     Rog'mar for its flight path, then the Swamp of Sorrows; 9 fly back to Rog'mar, the Riverglades quests up to
--     level 40 (Powderfuse Port's quests are in the 40-50 route); 10 fly to the Undercity, zeppelin to Orgrimmar, Freewind, the swarm quest in
--     Thousand Needles, the goblin hand-ins on the Shimmering Flats.
